flowchart TD
    REQ[Incoming request] --> SESSION{Valid authenticated session?}
    SESSION -- No --> DENY401[401 Unauthorized]
    SESSION -- Yes --> ROLE{Administrator-only action?}
    ROLE -- Yes --> ADMIN{Role is ADMIN?}
    ADMIN -- No --> DENY403[403 Forbidden]
    ADMIN -- Yes --> ACTION[Continue to admin handler]
    ROLE -- No --> OWNER{Private record access?}
    OWNER -- Yes --> CHECK{Is claimant or report owner?}
    CHECK -- No --> DENY403
    CHECK -- Yes --> ACTION2[Return only authorized private fields]
    OWNER -- No --> PUBLIC[Return explicit public fields only]
    ACTION --> DB[(MySQL)]
    ACTION2 --> DB
    PUBLIC --> DB
